    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">Carlos Ramirez has always been the Strikers&apos; best scorer. He pulls off bicycle kicks with ease, and his best friend, Tou Yang, knows exactly where to put the passes. But the state&apos;s best team, the Bandits, are coming to town, and Carlos hears that he&apos;ll have a very special fan in the stands. His uncle, a professional soccer player, will be watching his nephew&apos;s every move during the Strikers&apos; biggest game of the year. As the pressure to perform sets in, Carlos struggles to even hit the ball, let alone do bicycle kicks. Everyone has seen that Carlos is a gifted athlete, but no one knows whether he&apos;ll shine as the center of attention, or be blinded by the spotlight.</marc:subfield>
